1
00:00:00,700 --> 00:00:09,100
AI agents write code and move money. Yet payment rails cannot determine
whether offchain work met the agreed scope.

2
00:00:09,500 --> 00:00:18,700
ScopeSettle locks scope and settlement policy before funding
an ERC-8183 escrow on X Layer.

3
00:00:19,000 --> 00:00:28,700
Each deliverable binds one public pull request, its base commit, and one immutable head commit.
A moving branch cannot replace the evidence.

4
00:00:29,000 --> 00:00:40,700
Deterministic gates verify repository identity, required files, change bounds, and CI.
The hosted evaluator scores only evidence that survives validation.

5
00:00:41,000 --> 00:00:51,700
Every criterion exposes its score, reason, citations, and limitations.
Deterministic code recomputes the weighted result outside the model.

6
00:00:52,000 --> 00:01:00,700
On low confidence, ScopeSettle failed closed. The named reviewer rejected the verdict
and refunded the valueless Testnet escrow.

7
00:01:01,000 --> 00:01:10,700
The public certificate recomputes every binding, from report and rubric to evaluator
and verdict. Job three verifies ten out of ten.

8
00:01:11,000 --> 00:01:19,700
Open SDK and CLI checks run against X Layer RPC.
Integrators never need to trust the ScopeSettle server.

9
00:01:20,000 --> 00:01:29,700
The developer console adds scoped keys, signed webhooks, durable retries, and audits.
ScopeSettle: verified work, automatic settlement.
